[{"id":178908067,"discussion_id":"64a220a1c5db5984202197434f223fd8feb81169","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `aclnn_normal.cpp` 中 DAV_3510 架构下正态分布计算的精度问题（超32位切分精度问题）。核心改动是简化了 `normalDavidPath` 和 `normalTensorDavidPath` 两个函数中针对非 `DT_DOUBLE` 类型的路径：原先需先将 `self` 转为 float、构造 zeroMean/oneStd 并 BroadcastTo 到输出形状、调用 `StatelessNormal` 生成 N(0,1) 后再通过 L2 层 `Mul(std) + Add(mean)` 完成缩放偏移，现在改为直接将 `mean` 和 `std` 作为标量传入 `StatelessNormal`，在 kernel 内部一步完成 `z * std + mean` 的 FMA，消除中间舍入以提升精度。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **简化 `normalDavidPath` 的 DAV_3510 非 double 路径**：移除 `Cast`、`BroadcastTo`、`Mul`、`Add` 等多步操作，改为构造 `mean`/`std` 的 `FVector<float>` 标量张量后直接调用 `StatelessNormal`，kernel 内一次性完成 FMA 计算，减少 fp32→T 的中间舍入次数。\n- **简化 `normalTensorDavidPath` 的 DAV_3510 非 double 路径**：与上述改动一致，移除中间的 zeroMean/oneStd 广播与 Mul/Add 步骤，直接将 mean/std 传入 `StatelessNormal` 完成计算。\n- **移除不再需要的头文件依赖**：删除了 `#include \"conversion/broadcast_to/op_api/broadcast_to.h\"`，因简化后的路径不再使用 `BroadcastTo` 算子。\n- **代码格式统一调整**：多处函数签名换行方式变更（如 `normalDoublePath`、`normalDavidPath`、`aclnnInplaceNormalGetWorkspaceSize` 等），仅涉及格式化，无逻辑变化。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:51:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:46:01+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178908070,"discussion_id":"2bd729a780265ace9e3bea750b4ba9a8ff4f2cc1","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查总结\n\n### 已审查文件\n\n- **`random/dsa_random_normal/op_host/op_api/aclnn_normal.cpp`**：发现 2 个 P0 问题\n\n### 问题统计\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0     | 2    |\n| P1     | 0    |\n| P2     | 0    |\n| P3     | 0    |\n\n### 整体风险评估\n\n**高风险**。本次变更在 `normalDavidPath` 和 `normalTensorDavidPath` 两个函数的 DAV_3510 路径中，移除了 `BroadcastTo` 调用（旧代码将标量 mean/std 张量广播到 output shape 后再传入 `StatelessNormal`），改为直接传入标量张量。但 `StatelessNormal` kernel 的 tiling 代码明确要求 `meanSize == outputSize` 且 `stdevSize == outputSize`，注释写明\"L2 已完成广播\"。对于任何 outputSize > 1 的 shape，标量张量（size=1）将不满足该检查，导致 kernel 编译/tiling 阶段报错 `GRAPH_FAILED`。其余变更均为格式调整和无影响的 include 移除，无其他逻辑问题。\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 2 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:51:49+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:53:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178908099,"discussion_id":"362d1bb32bfa8f5452f81af2ae6d8a767b4a1a96","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n⚠️ This PR does not yet meet the following requirements:lgtm (requires ≥ 2 person(s) per module)、approve (requires ≥ 1 person(s) per module)\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| \\*/\\*/op_api/\\*.h | ❌ (0/2)(You can also ask: [*jia0liang*](https://gitcode.com/jia0liang), [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang), [*宋恺*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111), [*andong_hw*](https://gitcode.com/andong_hw), [*徐鲁威*](https://gitcode.com/loov1)) | ❌ (0/1)(You can also ask: [*汤磊*](https://gitcode.com/tang-lei01), [*王永光*](https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang)) |\n| \\*/\\*/op